#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_prototypes.json
msgid ""
"The Cataclysm has illuminated hitherto unknown facts about our universe.  The"
" opportunity to research - and perhaps understand - technology from not only "
"another world, but another dimension entirely, is an exceptionally promising "
"field of study.  Now more than ever is our continued delving into this field "
"of study paramount; while our focus has shifted rather abruptly, we believe "
"that if there is ever any chance of understanding or even reversing "
"<the_cataclysm>, it would come from studies like this."
msgstr "Kataklizm ujawnił nieznane dotąd fakty o naszym wszechświecie.  Możliwość zbadania — i być może zrozumienia — technologii pochodzącej nie tylko z innego świata, ale wręcz z innego wymiaru, stanowi wyjątkowo obiecujący kierunek badań.  Dalsze zgłębianie tej dziedziny jest teraz ważniejsze niż kiedykolwiek.  Choć dość gwałtownie zmieniliśmy kierunek prac, wierzymy, że jeśli istnieje jakakolwiek szansa, by zrozumieć lub nawet odwrócić <the_cataclysm>, to dadzą ją właśnie takie badania."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<combat_noise_warning>"
#. ~ NPC complaint that they heard combat noises that they can't see.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_combat.json
msgid "<general_noise_warning>  I've got a bad feeling about it."
msgstr "<general_noise_warning>  Mam co do tego złe przeczucia."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<combat_noise_warning>"
#. ~ NPC complaint that they heard combat noises that they can't see.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_combat.json
msgid "<general_noise_warning>  Shit might be hitting the fan over there."
msgstr "<general_noise_warning>  Tam może się robić niezły burdel."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<general_danger_h>"
#. ~ Hostile, swear-filled NPC complaint when the threat level increases from
#. very low to dangerous.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_combat.json
msgid "Fuck me sideways, we're in for a <freaking> time."
msgstr "Ja pierdolę, czeka nas <freaking> jazda."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<drop_it>"
#. ~ General warning to put a weapon down, either in preparation for a mugging
#. or by an scared NPC as part of a request to establish trust with the avatar.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_combat.json
msgid "Put your <freaking> weapon down!"
msgstr "Odłóż tę <freaking> broń!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "I can't even think straight, need sleep."
msgstr "Nie mogę nawet zebrać myśli, muszę się wyspać."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "This is why we can't have nice things, like a fully stocked larder."
msgstr "Właśnie dlatego nie możemy mieć niczego porządnego, choćby pełnej spiżarni."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "Uh-oh, the larder's as empty as my stomach."
msgstr "Oho, spiżarnia jest tak pusta jak mój żołądek."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<lets_talk>"
#. ~ NPCs shout these things while approaching the avatar for the first time
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_line.json
msgid "Hold up, let's chat!"
msgstr "Zaczekaj, pogadajmy!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<no_to_thorazine>"
#. ~ Hallucinatory NPCs say these things to discourage the avatar from taking
#. thorazine and ending the hallucination.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_line.json
msgid ""
"Sure, take Thorazine.  If you want to lose your mind and wander into a horde "
"of undead!"
msgstr "Jasne, weź Thorazine.  Jeśli chcesz stracić rozum i wleźć prosto w hordę nieumarłych!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "You bet.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr "Pewnie.  Chciałbym poznać twoją opinię o czymś innym."
